sections.content:
Our "Show Sass" tool makes it easy to learn Sass, it shows both the code and the result.

 Sass Example

 /* Define standard variables and values for website */
$bgcolor: lightblue;

 $textcolor: darkblue;
$fontsize: 18px;

/* Use the variables */
body
{
  background-color: $bgcolor;
  color: 
 $textcolor;
  font-size: $fontsize;
}

